  "music": "w1-doodle-docks",
  "authorNotes": "Solo. New mechanic: carrying (haul relic-w1-04-a, picked up right at spawn, and relic-w1-04-b on the middle pier — both must reach the goal together). The twist is lift-broken: a sticky note promises a lift straight across, but its authored path dips down and sideways first (750,900 to 750,1100 to 1050,1150) before finally climbing to the middle pier (1300,820) — riding it out is still the only way across, it just isn't the straight line the note implies, and the dip stays a safe 250px above the sea even at its lowest point. Grab relic-w1-04-a before boarding the lift so a fumbled carry doesn't cost a second trip. The second gap is a plain single swing (swing-final) back on familiar ground, carrying both relics to the goal. Assist beams span both gaps for players who'd rather not carry cargo across a swing."
